фог как в eclipse hub.\nСразу спасибо за всю проделаную работу.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-08-05T08:52:39.031Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6a72f9ede023172a3c6e97f9","commentBy":{"_id":"6a0457efeae4cacb6323f813","username":"Zeichar","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-08-30T18:54:30.908Z","createdAt":"2026-05-13T10:52:31.948Z","status":"offline","id":"6a0457efeae4cacb6323f813","profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Dear developers of this script, please improve the script in the following parameters:\n1. During the flight, the car somehow breaks down and, as a result, it flies slowly.\n2. When you enable the car’s acceleration, the turns are reverse (turn right — left). And you can set a single turn speed (reduce) so that the car doesn’t spin too much.\n3. Remove lags.\n4. Make the prediction bar more convenient so that it erases itself (for example, like in Eclipse hub — unfortunately, it doesn’t work).\n5. Finish the auto farm so that it starts immediately and immediately places and retrieves samples.\n6. Make an anti‑fog feature like in the Eclipse Hub.\nThank you in advance for all the work done.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-08-05T08:53:01.128Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}